keys ALWAYS
- quit ctrl+q
- refresh ctrl+r

> The base context is the layout's name.
keys MAIN
- open WELCOME w
- INSTALL i
- SET_WORKERS 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8

> The wizard's pages: q goes back too; other keys reach the menu.
keys POPUP passthrough
- back q esc

> Palette, borders and colours (spec §11). Terminal colours (`cyan`,
> `grey`) follow the user's terminal theme.
colors
- ACCENT 5fafd7

panels
- HEADER border rounded fg ACCENT
- SUMMARY border rounded
- MAIN_MENU border rounded
- LOG border single fg grey
- KEYBAR fg black bg cyan
- MENU.selected fg black bg cyan
- POPUP border double

logs
- LOG.stderr fg yellow
